hrough the human eras (Roman, medieval, modern, etc). New spells and upgrades unlock as you progress through the eras, but so do the enemies. Can you survive the extinction era?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Min-max resources and upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Min-max the resource systems and discover the fastest, most efficient resource upgrade path. Efficiently transition to new resource systems as they unlock through the human eras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/0df0e4351ccd767e30c4ab15eedf445f.poster.avif?t=1763400043\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/0df0e4351ccd767e30c4ab15eedf445f.webm?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/0df0e4351ccd767e30c4ab15eedf445f.mp4?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never-ending assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wave timers, no breaks between waves - the armies keep on coming, and they will never stop until they take back the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/d47d3ef6ce4a1dd40b5053f919b18e04.poster.avif?t=1763400043\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/d47d3ef6ce4a1dd40b5053f919b18e04.webm?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/d47d3ef6ce4a1dd40b5053f919b18e04.mp4?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your spells wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spells to compliment your towers, keep up with the waves, or boost your income. Feeling behind? Use your panic spells to buy some time and get a chance to catch up, but be careful as they are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/fd2b4e65e0b1b1f72f71c2a3ccb8d0b8.poster.avif?t=1763400043\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/fd2b4e65e0b1b1f72f71c2a3ccb8d0b8.webm?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/fd2b4e65e0b1b1f72f71c2a3ccb8d0b8.mp4?t=1763400043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** Generative AI was <u>not</u> used in the making or any promotion of Eternal Siege</p>","developers":["SIP Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/8dabe17fb98ac9a83df3d0b95699f725aca9bd7d/header.jpg?t=1763400043","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3491520/33929764/223a888b727f09567e2e7358f8700a008c809af9/1753488443/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753489489","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor